{"success":true,"site":"tmdb","sid":"movie/5528","tmdb_id":5528,"title":"放牛班的春天","original_title":"Les Choristes","overview":"1949年的法国乡村，音乐家克莱门特（杰勒德·尊诺 饰）到了一间外号叫“塘低”的男子寄宿学校当助理教师。学校里的学生大部分都是难缠的问题儿童，体罚在这里司空见惯，学校的校长（弗朗西斯·贝尔兰德 饰）只顾自己的前途，残暴高压。性格沉静的克莱门特尝试用自己的方法改善这种状况，他重新创作音乐作品，组织合唱团，决定用音乐的方法来打开学生们封闭的心灵。然而，事情并不顺利，克莱门特发现学生皮埃尔·莫安琦（尚·巴堤·莫里耶 饰）拥有非同一般的音乐天赋，但是单亲家庭长大的他，性格异常敏感孤僻，怎样释放皮埃尔的音乐才能，让克莱门特头痛不已；同时，他与皮埃尔母亲的感情也渐渐微妙起来。","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d623rdQLxw7QhdP7ECsz1UkJrHl.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eWYrrdCKd4bjOKB9DB0HtRUhI1o.jpg","release_date":"2004-03-17","year":"2004","runtime":"97 minutes","tmdb_rating_average":7.741,"tmdb_votes":2607,"tmdb_rating":"7.741 / 10 from 2607 users","genres":["剧情","喜剧","音乐"],"languages":["French"],"countries":["France","Switzerland"],"production_companies":["Galatée Films","Pathé Renn Productions","Vega Film","France 2 Cinéma","Novo Arturo Films"],"directors":[{"name":"克里斯托夫·巴哈蒂","id":43993}],"producers":[{"name":"Arthur Cohn","id":10032},{"name":"Nicolas Mauvernay","id":20029},{"name":"雅克·贝汉","id":20030}],"cast":[{"id":21171,"name":"热拉尔·朱尼奥","original_name":"Gérard Jugnot","character":"Clément Mathieu","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/8fvIsaf0a5e60IvtNddKCcOZXFO.jpg"},{"id":7693,"name":"弗朗索瓦·贝莱昂","original_name":"François Berléand","character":"Rachin","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/5TDYSUfCj8vaG5sqJXUU06Cvafa.jpg"},{"id":22306,"name":"凯德·麦拉德","original_name":"Kad Merad","character":"Chabert","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/2hgcdLF0GqtzUGUFATH9AwLfS7J.jpg"},{"id":43998,"name":"让-保罗·博奈雷","original_name":"Jean-Paul Bonnaire","character":"Father Maxence","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/ebowJ2uZ36tPYbGrW4BT3FuBfd8.jpg"},{"id":28793,"name":"玛丽·布奈尔","original_name":"Marie Bunel","character":"Violette Morhange","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/o2dfyNcYoFn5cnYlb